&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience in preparing and reviewing PAS 9980 appraisals or similar risk-based assessments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
