&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee financial reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; You will be responsible for deferred tax positions (IFRS and HGB) in annual, consolidated, and quarterly financial statements, as well as financial planning.&lt;/li&gt;
